# Minuten versetzt (Auftrag adorfer/Buildsystem 05.10.2026): nicht alle Jobs zur
# vollen Stunde und zu jeder Fuenferminute, wo schon Gluons
# tunneldigger-watchdog (*/5) laeuft. Plan ueber alle Feed-Jobs: linkcheck :x2,
# watchdog :x3, healthcheck 5-59/7, gateway.sh 6-59/8, wifi-blackout 1-59/10,
# IfNoWificlient 14-59/15, check_wifi_firmware 1-59/3 - hoechstens zwei teure
# Jobs je Minute (mit check_wifi_firmware an zwei Minuten drei).
# micrond kennt nur "a-b/n": "5/7" allein hiesse nur Minute 5.
5-59/7 * * * * /lib/gluon/neanderfunk-hotfix/healthcheck.sh
14-59/15 * * * * /lib/gluon/neanderfunk-hotfix/IfNoWificlient.sh

3-59/5 * * * * /lib/gluon/neanderfunk-hotfix/watchdog.sh

# Own entry rather than a line in healthcheck.sh: a crashed wifi firmware
# leaves the node deaf, and waiting out healthcheck's 7 minute period twice
# would take a quarter of an hour. The check is two globs and a read.
1-59/3 * * * * /lib/gluon/neanderfunk-hotfix/check_wifi_firmware.sh

# Every minute: after a TX timeout the check has to see tx_packets stand for
# three runs, and a node whose ethernet is dead is cut off entirely. On nodes
# without mtk_soc_eth it ends after two globs, without starting a process.
* * * * * /lib/gluon/neanderfunk-hotfix/check_eth_tx_stall.sh
